      ],
      "resourceTypes": ["raw"],
      "globals": [],
      "notes": "Empty VAST 4 document. resource-type raw is the WebKit type for XHR and fetch in both the iOS 17 and iOS 26 flavours. Scoped to output=vast so it cannot pre-empt the VMAP surrogate, which is emitted after it."
